<p id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Ego4D <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib30" title="" class="ltx_ref">Grauman et al., 2022</a>)</cite>  CC BY 4.0 License</p>
</div></li>
